diff --git a/changelog.d/354.fixed.md b/changelog.d/354.fixed.md
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/354.fixed.md
@@ -0,0 +1,1 @@
+- Propulsion mode changes (sail to motor and back) are now priced as time inside the router, via a new user-adjustable "Mode change penalty (s)" setting defaulting to 45 s, so a route no longer switches propulsion for a gain smaller than the switch itself costs (#354).
